{"id":"fb8a113c2891ff19","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-smullyan-diagonal.md","title":"Smullyan Diagonalization","display":"df-smullyan-diagonal — Smullyan Diagonalization","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-smullyan-diagonal","aliases":["90-df-smullyan-diagonal"],"display":"df-smullyan-diagonal — Smullyan Diagonalization","depends_on":["[[90-df-godel-numbering]]","[[90-df-substitution-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-smullyan-diagonal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-smullyan-diagonal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-smullyan-diagonal — Smullyan Diagonalization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7279c20158ac140e\" href=\"?note=7279c20158ac140e\" title=\"90-df-substitution-function\">90-df-substitution-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (fixed arithmetical signature)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> (code of a formula with designated free variable)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}_S(e,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}_S(e,n)\\)</span> (coded numeral substitution, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7279c20158ac140e\" href=\"?note=7279c20158ac140e\" title=\"90-df-substitution-function\">90-df-substitution-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SmDiag}\">\\(\\operatorname{SmDiag}\\)</span> (Smullyan diagonal map, defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}diagonal}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\operatorname{SmDiag}(e)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sub}_S(e,e).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}diagonal}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\operatorname{SmDiag}(e)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sub}_S(e,e).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e=\\ulcorner\\varphi(v)\\urcorner\">\\(e=\\ulcorner\\varphi(v)\\urcorner\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SmDiag}(e)=\\ulcorner\\varphi(\\overline e)\\urcorner\">\\(\\operatorname{SmDiag}(e)=\\ulcorner\\varphi(\\overline e)\\urcorner\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>该定义输出公式编码，而不是把数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 当作可以直接“应用”的表达式对象。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b86b211a75cf1748","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-substitution-function","status":"resolved","id":"7279c20158ac140e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-substitution-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-substitution-function","status":"resolved","id":"7279c20158ac140e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sub}_S(e,n)$ (coded numeral substitution, see [[90-df-substitution-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":